  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water, essential element for Venezuelan Children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project proposes the installation of a drinking water plant and a deep well to provide this essential element for the life and health of the community of Turgua in Venezuela. The goal is to meet the basic needs of access to drinking and healthy water for consumption by families and especially children, who are part of this student community.</narrative>
  </description>
